From cc2ae9cc548458573df904fb923c712a3a17ed65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:17:20 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: training menu for stats and Psynergy

After each monster battle won, and whenever the attendant is spoken to, a menu
lets the player spend coins on base stats and a 32-entry Psynergy shop for
Isaac, Garet, Ivan and Mia. A win pays 200 coins plus 100 per earlier win in
the series; New Game starts with 1500. Guarded by ARENA_TRAINING in
scene/battle_arena.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 games/tbs/src/scene/battle_arena.c        | 425 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 games/tbs/src/scene/file_screen.c         |   3 +-
 games/tbs/src/scene/import/battle_arena.s |   4 +
 games/tbs/src/system/overlay/imports.inc  |   1 +
 4 files changed, 432 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

